<span class="eyebrow">Services</span>
<h1>Permit drawings for houses and small buildings</h1>
<p>Renotect is led by a BCIN Qualified Designer, so we prepare permit and construction drawings for houses and small buildings in Toronto and across the GTA. Because the same studio also designs the space, the drawings you submit for permit match the project you actually want to build.</p>
